      "updated": 1785000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE \u221240% LATENCY / \u221230% COST STORY\nName the mechanisms and what each one cost you:\n  1. prompt-prefix caching on the frozen system prompt\n  2. retrieval funnel cut (top-k down, rerank up)\n  3. routing the easy majority to a smaller model\nStreaming is SEPARATE \u2014 perceived latency, not total.",
      "originalText": "THE \u221240% LATENCY / \u221230% COST STORY\nName the mechanisms and what each one cost you:\n  1. prompt-prefix caching on the frozen system prompt\n  2. retrieval funnel cut (top-k down, rerank up)\n  3. routing the easy majority to a smaller model\nStreaming is SEPARATE \u2014 perceived latency, not total.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "el1800554207",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
